[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_8psga"]
script = ExtResource("6_r4mep")
name = "README.TXT"
icon = ExtResource("8_b7ewl")
contents = "RAYTRACE 2.0

Thank you for choosing Raytrace 2! Registered users get the
printed manual and the next version on floppy disk.

QUICK START
  Open a scene file (.RAY) to render it. The picture is saved
  as a .BMP next to the scene file.

RENDER TIMES
  A complex scene can take many hours, and your computer works
  hard the whole time. Make sure it has good air flow, and keep
  the fan and the vents free of dust.

PROBLEMS?
  If your computer turns itself off during a render, it is
  probably too hot. Let it cool down, and clean it.
"
modified = "Thursday, November 2, 1995 12:00:00 PM"

